    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`monoNode0` is a local runtime node under `monoServer`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this node for node-scoped local configuration and activation. Server-wide topology belongs in `monoServer`, and capability behavior belongs in active modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Node settings should remain explicit, observable, and safe to rebalance across sibling nodes."
    }
  ],
